      <p begin="00:19.490" end="00:22.860" ttm:agent="v1">Kissy face, kissy face, sent to your phone, but</p>
      <p begin="00:22.860" end="00:25.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm trying to kiss your lips for real (uh-huh, uh-huh)</p>
